Paragraph 148 has *strong*, /emphasis/, `inline code`, and a [link][site].

- first list item
- second list item

  - nested item with *strong*
  - another nested item

> A block quote with /emphasis/ and a [direct link](https://example.com/path).

```js
function section148(value) {
  return value + 148;
}
```

